# forgeline-sample

Small task app used to demo Forgeline: a GraphQL server and a React + TypeScript web app.

- `server/`: graphql-yoga, in-memory store, http://localhost:4000/graphql
- `web/`: Vite + React + urql, http://localhost:5173 (proxies /graphql to the server)

```
npm install
npm run dev     # server and web together
npm test        # vitest, both packages
npm run lint    # tsc --noEmit
```
